│ trajectories                                                                 │
│   - Access: `x1 = data['state'\][0, :\]`, `x2 = data['state'\][1, :\]`       │
│ - `input`: numpy array, shape `(num_inputs, num_steps)` - input signals (if  │
│ applicable)                                                                  │
│   - Access: `u1 = data['input'\][0, :\]`                                     │
│                                                                              │
│ **WARNING**: Do NOT use placeholder names like `<npz_0>` as file paths! Use  │
│ the `data_analysis_expert` agent which has access to the actual file paths.  │
